<title>NETHERLANDS: Van Lanschot ups Boskalis to outperform.</title>
<headline>Van Lanschot ups Boskalis to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (20/06)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Boskalis	  Dredging	38.20   Van Lanschot Bankiers</p>
<p>COMMENT: Outperformer(was underperformer). Based on H1 expectations, see 37 pct rise in stock price over 12 months. Developments in key markets promising, especially Far East. This has boosted capacity utilization, while orderbook at high level.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     2.42    15.8   6.3    1.10</p>
<p>    1997		  3.00    12.7   5.6    1.20</p>
<p>    1998		  3.50    10.9   5.0    1.45</p>
<p>((-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)))</p>
